.TH SDL_GetGPUTextureFormatFromPixelFormat 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetGPUTextureFormatFromPixelFormat \- Get the GPU texture format corresponding to an SDL pixel format.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_gpu.h>
.PP
.BI "SDL_GPUTextureFormat SDL_GetGPUTextureFormatFromPixelFormat(SDL_PixelFormat format);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I format
a pixel format\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the corresponding GPU texture format, or
.BR SDL_GPU_TEXTUREFORMAT_INVALID
if there is no corresponding GPU texture format\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]4\[char46]0\[char46]

